			description: [
				"&d&lMystical Agriculture.&r"
				""
				"Mystical Agriculture grows &oresources&r. Iron. Diamonds. Nether stars, eventually. You plant a seed, and the thing you used to sieve for just... grows."
				""
				"None of this is required to win - it is the &l\"become disgustingly rich\"&r branch. The void has no prosperity ore, so this kit is your seed capital: shards, essence, and your first Inferium Seeds."
