		{
			dependencies: ["655E000000000004"]
			description: [
				"Craft &eIron Seeds&r on the altar and plant them. Congratulations: you are now farming a mine. Every resource seed works this way - check JEI for the full catalogue."
				""
				"&e&lHow a resource seed is made:&r put the &7Infusion Altar&r in the middle, ring it with four &7Pedestals&r, drop the tier's essence on the pedestals and the base ingredients in the middle. The altar does the rest."
				""
				"&e&lThe seed tier decides what farmland it needs.&r A tier-4 seed will not grow on tier-1 Inferium farmland. Match them or nothing happens and it looks broken."
				""
				"&e&lThe seeds that actually change this pack:&r"
				"&7- &fOsmium&7 - breaks the Mekanism bottleneck"
				"&7- &fUraninite&7 - makes Powah reactors sustainable"
				"&7- &fDiamond / Obsidian&7 - the Elite and Ultimate circuit wall"
				"&7- &fDesh, Ostrum, Calorite&7 - SkyForge adds planet-metal seeds, so you can farm what you flew for"
				"&7- &fNether Star&7 - yes, really"
				""
				"&c&lNote the planet seeds still require the trip first&r - you need the ingot to craft the seed. They make the metals sustainable, not free."
				""
				"&8Plant one of everything early. A farm running in the background for fifty hours is worth more than any single machine you could build with that time."
			]
			icon: "minecraft:iron_ingot"
			id: "655E000000000005"
			rewards: [{
				id: "655E000000000107"
				item: "mysticalagriculture:diamond_seeds"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "&7Farm a mine"
			tasks: [{
