			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["655E000000000003"]
			description: ["Compress up the ladder: &ePrudentium&r, then &eTertium&r. Each tier unlocks stronger seeds and better gear. The grind is real; the payoff is worse mobs fearing you."]
