		}
		{
			dependencies: ["655E000000000004"]
			description: [
				"&eGrowth Accelerators&r sit under your farmland and tick the crops above. Stack them in a pillar - each one is another push. Your essence farm becomes a green blur."
				""
				"&e&lThey stack downward, and that is the trick.&r One accelerator directly under the farmland helps a little. A column of ten under the same block is ten times the growth ticks. Build &ldown&r, not out - you are on a floating island, and vertical space is the one thing you have plenty of."
				""
				"&e&lTiers matter more than count:&r Inferium, Prudentium, Tertium, Imperium and Supremium accelerators each tick faster than the last. Ten Supremium accelerators beat fifty Inferium ones and take a fifth of the space."
				""
				"&c&lThey draw no power but they do cost performance.&r Every accelerator is a block ticking constantly. A few hundred of them will hurt your server's tick rate - which matters here, since the standing rule on this machine is nothing that slows things down."
				""
				"&7Combine with a Watering Can or Cyclic Sprinkler for a further multiplier, and harvest with a Harvester or Botany Pots so the whole farm runs unattended.&r"
				""
				"&8This is how essence farming stops being a grind. Without accelerators you are waiting on vanilla crop timers; with them, Supremium is a weekend rather than a month."
			]
			icon: "mysticalagriculture:inferium_growth_accelerator"
			id: "655E000000000008"
			rewards: [{
				id: "655E00000000010A"
				item: "mysticalagriculture:mystical_fertilizer"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "&7Faster. FASTER."
			tasks: [{
				count: 2L
				id: "655E000000000208"
				item: "mysticalagriculture:inferium_growth_accelerator"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "&dGrowth Accelerators"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["655E000000000007"]
			description: [
				"&5&lThe space metals are the ones people assume they can never automate.&r"
				""
				"Desh, ostrum and calorite are hand-mined on the Moon, Mars and Venus, and they gate a great deal of the pack - the ME Controller, AE2 autocrafting, Powahs high crystals and Mekanisms Elite and Ultimate circuits."
				""
				"&a&lThey are renewable, just not through Mystical Agriculture.&r There are no essence seeds for them. The answer is &eProductive Bees&r:"
				""
				"&7Show a &fSteel Bee&r &7a &fBlock of Desh&r &7and it becomes a &fDesh Bee&r&7. Same for Ostrum and Calorite.&r"
				""
				"So each planet costs &lone trip&r. Bring home nine ingots, press them into a block, convert a bee, and centrifuge the combs from then on."
				""
				"&8See &7Desh, Ostrum and Calorite Bees&8 in the Productive Bees chapter for the full loop."
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:desh_ingot"
